A.mount(s3, '<p class="cap">Data: interp_env_breakeven_sensitivity.csv, row CENTRAL (2022 inputs). Own buildings: Amazon NA logistics floor space (10-K) x CBECS warehouse energy x grid and gas factors. Own delivery: van and middle-mile trucks per package at an assumed $' + PV("amazon_usd_per_package") + ' per package; air and returns are not in the central case, so own emissions are a floor. Avoided trips: NHTS 2022 shopping vehicle-miles per $1,000 of in-store sales (Census ARTS) x car factor. Avoided buildings: store floor space per dollar (Walmart and Target) x CBECS retail energy x an assumed ' + NP(PV("substitution_realisation"), 0) + ' that is really avoided (vacant stores keep their energy).</p>');

